WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.400
Crouching medium kick catches Ryu’s low recovery as a Punish Counter.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:01.950
Heavy Somersault Kick links after the low kick.

3
00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:02.900
Ryu rises from the charged special.

4
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:03.200
Ryu lands at the end of the two-hit punish.
